<title>USA: Storage Tech unit wins $1.1 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Storage Tech unit wins $1.1 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Storage Technology Corp said Friday its Network Systems unit was awarded a $1.1 million contract from the U.S. Department of Defense.</p>
<p>The contract is for the continued development of Asynchronous Transfer Mode network security solutions. It is an extension of a 1995 contract valued at $400,000.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
